<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16094" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ĕrĕbus</span></b> , i,
			m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρεβος</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>The god of darkness</i>, <i>son of
				Chaos</i>, <i>and brother of Nox</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D. 3,
				17 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; Hyg. Myth. praef.; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 4,
				510</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 14, 404</span></i>.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>The Lower World</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 4,
				471</span></i> Serv.; <i><span class="en">id. A. 6, 247</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7, 140</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Ov. M.
				5, 543</span></i>; <i><span class="en">10, 76</span></i>, al.—Hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ĕrĕbēus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>of or belonging to the
				Lower World</i>: colubrae, Ov. lb. 229.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
